       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Ordered:** 1600 mg four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum dose:** The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day for prescription use, usually given as 400\u2013800 mg per dose. The ordered daily total is twice that limit. A single 1600 mg dose is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** At this dose the patient would face a high risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day), or 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- 400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours for standard analgesia or anti-inflammatory use\n- 1600 mg total per day, such as 400 mg four times daily\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it right away. If you do intend 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first, and I can add a note to the order documenting the rationale."
      }
